! trust for laptop (operator, web) can be claimed until 2026-03-01 09:15:00 UTC

$ jailops trust add --name laptop --role operator --projects web
<trust-token>
! warning: this trust token is shown only once and works only once; hand it to the new client now.
! trust for laptop (operator, web) can be claimed until 2026-03-01 10:00:00 UTC

$ jailops trust add --role operator --global
! usage: --name is required
